Privacy-Preserving Text Classiﬁcation on BERT Embeddings with Homomorphic Encryption
Garam Lee*1 Minsoo Kim*2 Jai Hyun Park*2 Seung-won Hwang†2 Jung Hee Cheon1,2 1CryptoLab 2Seoul National University
garamlee@cryptolab.co.kr
