2 Method

We focus on the scenario in which the user directly applies the privacy mechanism to the output embeddings from a neural text encoder, before passing it on to a service provider for usage in a downstream task. Such a scenario is also referred to as a local privacy setting (Qu et al., 2021). The privatization procedure Mpriv can be deﬁned as follows:

Mpriv(x) = P (Femb(x))

